      "writtenOn": "2023-03-15T09:35:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This carries over previous behavior which is fine, but the cache should actually be cleared when the TTL expires, even if there is no QueryTask at that time (it could be 20s later).\n\nYou could have a SparseArray\u003cMdnsResponse\u003e indexed by expiration date, and schedule a message on the handler for the next one. Maybe in another change ?",
