      "writtenOn": "2023-03-22T03:57:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I update the design that TTL check will be triggered every 120s. But I\u0027m not sure how to use the SparseArray\u003cMdnsResponse\u003e that you suggest. The key-expiration date is an int that can be duplicated, so it might lose some responses during saving. Besides, I look up and check ttl time on all responses now, I\u0027m not sure how to make it more efficient by using another array for checking.",
